      {
        "id": 141820,
        "name": "Amnachaidh",
        "username": "Amnachaidh",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-22T16:56:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It is also worth noting that damage dealt is not limited to the available hit points. Hit points go negative with overkill. This can be very important for some characters like Absolute Zero and, per recent rule clarification, Mr. Fixer.</p>",
